reen's theorem, Stokes' theorem, and the divergence theorem.", "catalogBreadth": "", "catalogDistr": "(MQR-AS)", "catalogEnrollmentPriority": null, "catalogLang": "", "catalogForbiddenOverlaps": "Forbidden Overlap: due to an overlap in content, students will receive credit for only one course in the following group: MATH 1920, MATH 2130, MATH 2220, MATH 2240. For guidance in selecting an appropriate course, please consult First Steps in Math.", "catalogAttribute": "", "catalogWhenOffered": "Fall, Spring, Summer.", "catalogComments": "", "catalogPrereqCoreq": "Prerequisite: MATH 1910\u00a0or equivalent AP credit.", "catalogPrereq": null, "catalogCoreq": null, "catalogFee": "", "catalogSatisfiesReq": "", "catalogPermission": "", "catalogCourseSubfield": "", "catalogOutcomes": null, "acadCareer": "UG", "acadGroup": "AS", "lastTermsOffered": null, "exploreCriteriaIds": null}, {"strm": 2734, "crseId": 352295, "crseOfferNbr": 1, "subject": "MATH", "catalogNbr": "2930", "titleShort": "Differential Equations Engrs", "titleLong": "Differential Equations for Engineers", "crseAttrs": [], "crseAttrValueGroups": [], "enrollGroups": [{"classSections": [{"ssrComponent": "LEC", "ssrComponentLong": "Lecture", "section": "001", "classNbr": 1169, "meetings": [{"classMtgNbr": 1, "timeStart": "08:30AM", "timeEnd": "09:45AM", "startDt": "06/24/2019", "endDt": "08/02/2019", "instructors": [{"instrAssignSeq": 4, "netid": "av568", "firstName": "Andrew", "middleName": "", "lastName": "van Paridon"}], "pattern": "MTWRF", "facilityDescr": "Malott Hall 406", "bldgDescr": "Malott Hall", "facilityDescrshort": "MLT406", "meetingTopicDescription": ""}], "notes": [{"classNotesSeq": 1, "descrlong": "This Summer Session class is offered by the School of Continuing Education and Summer Sessions. For details visit http://www.sce.cornell.edu/ss/courses/courses.php?v=780"}], "campus": "MAIN", "campusDescr": "Ithaca", "location": "ITH", "locationDescr": "Ithaca, NY (Main Campus)", "startDt": "06/24/2019", 